@JuliGastos.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5116
@token = your-jwt-token-here

GET {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Auth Endpoints

### Register User
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "currencyCode": "COP",
  "emergencyFundMonths": 3
}

###

### Login User
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

# Account Endpoints

### Create Account - Efectivo
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Efectivo Principal",
  "type": "Cash",
  "currencyCode": "COP",
  "initialBalance": 500000,
  "monthlyMaintenanceFee": 0
}

###

### Create Account - Bancolombia Ahorros
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bancolombia Ahorros",
  "type": "Savings",
  "currencyCode": "COP",
  "initialBalance": 2000000,
  "monthlyMaintenanceFee": 12000
}

###

### Create Account - Tarjeta de Crédito
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Oro",
  "type": "CreditCard",
  "currencyCode": "COP",
  "initialBalance": 0,
  "monthlyMaintenanceFee": 25000
}

###

### Get All Accounts
GET {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Account By UUID (replace with actual UUID from create response)
GET {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
